<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom" xmlns:content="http://purl.org/rss/1.0/modules/content/"><channel><title>ICU on 快乐每一天</title><link>https://www.zgia.net/tags/icu/</link><description>Recent content in ICU on 快乐每一天</description><generator>Hugo -- 0.153.3</generator><language>zh-CN</language><lastBuildDate>Mon, 01 Oct 2012 22:31:20 +0000</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://www.zgia.net/tags/icu/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>给Mac的PHP添加gettext扩展</title><link>https://www.zgia.net/2012/10/%E7%BB%99mac%E7%9A%84php%E6%B7%BB%E5%8A%A0gettext%E6%89%A9%E5%B1%95/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Oct 2012 22:29:48 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://www.zgia.net/2012/10/%E7%BB%99mac%E7%9A%84php%E6%B7%BB%E5%8A%A0gettext%E6%89%A9%E5%B1%95/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;本来以为就这么简单，下载与Mac匹配的PHP源码，然后&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;cd ext/gettext&lt;br&gt;
phpize&lt;br&gt;
./configure&lt;br&gt;
make&lt;br&gt;
sudo make install&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;谁知道遇到错误：configure: error: Cannot locate header file libintl.h&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;google了一下，这里有解决办法：&lt;a href="http://mansion.im/2011/php-with-intl-and-gettext-on-osx-lion" title="PHP with Intl and Gettext on OSX Lion"&gt;PHP with Intl and Gettext on OSX Lion&lt;/a&gt;。&lt;/p&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>